{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Huh?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DateBoy involves playing on a <span class=\"bb_strike\">Ga</span> <strong><i>retro</i></strong> <strong><i>handheld video game console</i></strong> while you're on a DATE! Hence, DateBoy. DATE. BOY. Get it? DateBoy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES! GIVE ME FEATURES! AHHHHH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well how bout you try the flippin game and see for yourself? It only lasts like <strong>15-30 minutes</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I can't! I am but a mere Steam description Heading-2 text, cruelly contained within the dark realm of the description box!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let me break it down then, you poor thing. DateBoy involves:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong><i>boy</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >on a <strong><i>date</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >playing his <span class=\"bb_strike\">Gam</span> <strong><i>retro</i></strong> <strong><i>handheld video game console</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are that <strong><i>boy</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not <i>really</i>, but in the game you play <strong><i>as</i></strong> the <strong><i>boy</i></strong> on that <strong><i>date</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you speak to your date.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you don't <i>really</i> speak to her, but you select <strong>dialogue options</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while also playing a <span class=\"bb_strike\">Game</span> <strong><i>generic</i></strong> <strong><i>portable</i></strong> <strong><i>handheld video game console originally developed in the late 80s</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and lots of <strong><i>hi-la-ri-ous</i></strong> things happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's a funny waiter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DateBoy</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sounds dumb.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're dumb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"hello!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/b70c128f87a183a31cdaa617fc484e495a459ccf.jpg"},{"name":"maaaaargheritaaa!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/d469876d1e79f977659935fb128e76d899f18f88.jpg"},{"name":"hmmmmayybeee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/f0262e800b2522bdacbf26224c278150a4d9dc10.jpg"},{"name":"rip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/03b0258c071f863122c6a6e02457c142acdcd649.jpg"},{"name":"F#@%ING RIGGED!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/439cddf5744656dc23d17c7ab81f985b1ca7028b.jpg"},{"name":"marry me.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/fcb600940269bbbbe07fbfc2dbe51f3034ff5cae.jpg"},{"name":"attentive, eh?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/94c58f126d91561c905cc8ca869befb0d5e27c14.jpg"},{"name":"good try!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/54720f586aaf03d0eb9e3b20bcb7d9a2e67c91e3.jpg"},{"name":"mm mm mmmmm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/aa29b846547e46c2d4d462cf08f91f6f8b4aaaa3.jpg"},{"name":"just the 2 of us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022300/2aa10200f28ab435cad1574822a78d043f7efbcd.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022300?t=17684